ight green, 5-6 minutes. Remove from heat.","secondary_message":"1 ½ tbsp extra virgin olive oil"},{"id":61485,"primary_message":"Wash and dry arugula. Wash, trim stem ends, and thinly slice strawberries.","secondary_message":"1 ½ (142 g) pkg baby arugula\n1 ½ (454 g) pkg strawberries"},{"id":61484,"primary_message":"In a large bowl, combine and toss arugula, strawberries, and asparagus.","secondary_message":""},{"id":61483,"primary_message":"To serve, arrange salad on a plate, crumble goat cheese over top, sprinkle with almonds, and drizzle with dressing. Enjoy!","secondary_message":"1 ½ (113 g) log goat cheese\n¾ cup almonds"}],"line_items":[{"id":65274,"quantity":"¾ cup","ingredient_name":"almonds"},{"id":65273,"quantity":"3 small bunches","ingredient_name":"asparagus"},{"id":65283,"quantity":"1 ½ (142 g) pkg","ingredient_name":"baby arugula"},{"id":65276,"quantity":"3 cloves","ingredient_name":"garlic"},{"id":65275,"quantity":"1 ½ (113 g) logs","ingredient_name":"goat cheese"},{"id":65277,"quantity":"1 ½","ingredient_name":"lemons"},{"id":65284,"quantity":"1 ½ (454 g) pkgs","ingredient_name":"strawberries"},{"id":65278,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"balsamic vinegar"},{"id":65279,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"black pepper"},{"id":65280,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"extra virgin olive oil"},{"id":65281,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"honey"},{"id":65282,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"salt"}],"nutrition":{"energy":489.71,"alcohol":0.0,"ash":3.09,"caffeine":0.0,"water":281.89,"carbs":26.53,"fiber":7.71,"starch":6.59,"sugars":16.12,"fructose":7.72,"galactose":0.25,"glucose":6.38,"lactose":0.0,"maltose":0.11,"sucrose":1.68,"sugar_alcohol":0.0,"fat":39.61,"monounsaturated":24.55,"polyunsaturated":5.22,"omega_3":0.33,"omega_6":4.89,"saturated":8.21,"transfats":0.24,"cholesterol":13.0,"protein":13.52,"alanine":0.45,"arginine":0.75,"aspartic_acid":1.52,"cystine":0.11,"glutamic_acid":2.5,"glycine":0.46,"histidine":0.31,"isoleucine":0.46,"leucine":0.91,"lysine":